# Pairs with PerKeyCoverage: the range filter hands a key to the tenant layer unless the operator layer denies it, so a tenant deny revokes an operator allow.

MODULE: RangeComposesOnEffect
TARGET: PerKeyCoverage
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the range filter hands a key to the tenant layer unless the operator layer denies it, so a tenant deny revokes an operator allow
PERTURBS: EvaluateRange

--- FIND
               IN IF o.matched THEN o.effect = "Allow"
--- REPLACE
               IN IF o.matched /\ o.effect = "Deny" THEN FALSE
--- END
